pref-delete-command-help = Advanced custom command template for syncing deletions from Zotero back to Notion.
pref-prompt-help = Optional custom reading-guide prompt. Leave empty to use the built-in default. Your custom text is saved in Zotero preferences and survives plugin upgrades.
pref-prompt-presets-label = Saved prompt presets
